<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean firms buy 21,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean firms buy 21,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Cheiljedang Corp and Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd jointly bought on Wednesday 21,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat from Japanese trading house Marubeni Corp, company officials said.</p>
</text>
